{
 "duration": 52.898,
 "exact_word_timing": true,
 "lines": [
  {
   "beat": 0,
   "text": "Streamers found five secrets in GTA 6 nobody told you about.",
   "start": 0.15,
   "end": 4.521
  },
  {
   "beat": 1,
   "text": "Number one.",
   "start": 4.971,
   "end": 5.918
  },
  {
   "beat": 1,
   "text": "Speed walked right up to an alligator. Bad idea.",
   "start": 6.138,
   "end": 9.18
  },
  {
   "beat": 1,
   "text": "It lunged, grabbed Jason, and dragged him straight through the grass.",
   "start": 9.4,
   "end": 12.724
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "Number two.",
   "start": 13.174,
   "end": 14.196
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "This parrot keeps saying, hey handsome.",
   "start": 14.416,
   "end": 16.446
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "Ask it where the cash is, and it screams, generator!",
   "start": 16.666,
   "end": 19.273
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "Behind the grate? Fourteen hundred and five dollars.",
   "start": 19.493,
   "end": 22.544
  },
  {
   "beat": 3,
   "text": "Number three.",
   "start": 22.994,
   "end": 24.017
  },
  {
   "beat": 3,
   "text": "Lirik came up in the middle of the ocean, and a German shepherd was just sitting on a jet ski.",
   "start": 24.237,
   "end": 29.037
  },
  {
   "beat": 3,
   "text": "He climbed on, and the dog drove him back to shore.",
   "start": 29.257,
   "end": 32.058
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "Number four.",
   "start": 32.508,
   "end": 33.507
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "Jason has a pet snake named Dolores.",
   "start": 33.727,
   "end": 35.989
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "And yes, you can feed her a rat. She eats it.",
   "start": 36.209,
   "end": 38.847
  },
  {
   "beat": 5,
   "text": "Number five.",
   "start": 39.297,
   "end": 40.296
  },
  {
   "beat": 5,
   "text": "Lirik spotted Bigfoot in the swamp.",
   "start": 40.516,
   "end": 42.383
  },
  {
   "beat": 5,
   "text": "He went looking for him, blacked out, and woke up alone, asking, did he do something to me?",
   "start": 42.603,
   "end": 47.615
  },
  {
   "beat": 6,
   "text": "Which one would catch you off guard first?",
   "start": 48.065,
   "end": 50.102
  },
  {
   "beat": 6,
   "text": "Because that alligator...",
   "start": 50.322,
   "end": 52.048
  }
 ],
